        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3d2b463c-21fd-56e5-925f-adbd30df44ec",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2007 Canadian Grand Prix, 2017 Canadian Grand Prix\n- Places: Circuit Gilles Villeneuve, Montreal, Quebec, Canada\n- People: Lewis Hamilton, Lance Stroll\n- Organizations: FIA Formula One\n- Topics: Formula One drivers from Canada\n\nFacts:\n- The 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held on 10 June 2007 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Lewis Hamilton's victory at the 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was his first win in Formula One and made him the first black driver to win a Formula One race.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is a motor racing circuit in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is the venue for the FIA Formula One Canadian Grand Prix.\n- The 2017 Canadian Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held on 11 June 2017 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Canadian drivers were absent from Formula One after a departure in 2006 until Lance Stroll arrived in 2017.\n- Lance Stroll scored his first career points at the 2017 Canadian Grand Prix.",
